{"type":"META","ticket":4637,"id":"META"}||{"title":"5011_C238127","tags":["连接器","测试点/测试环"],"source":"de49c5548d234f0398663b8933aca786|0819f05c4eef4c71ace90d822a990e87","images":["https://alimg.szlcsc.com/upload/public/product/middle/20230108/786CB7B4BC2721DAAE28FA0AF31087CA.jpg"],"attributes":{"LCSC Part Name":"通孔安装测试点，颜色标识","Supplier Part":"C238127","Manufacturer":"Keystone","Manufacturer Part":"5011","Supplier Footprint":"-","JLCPCB Part Class":"Extended Part","Datasheet":"https://item.szlcsc.com/datasheet/5011/237375.html","Supplier":"LCSC","Add into BOM":"yes","Convert to PCB":"yes","Symbol":"fe009afe59d6e898","Designator":"U?","Footprint":"3b5aaa45b8a2f4a5","3D Model":"3f328196693c46b8b64bb4dff555d2a9|0819f05c4eef4c71ace90d822a990e87","3D Model Title":"TEST-TH_BD3.17-P1.87","3D Model Transform":"124.803,124.377,0,0,0,0,-0.984,0,-129.921","Connector Type":"插针型(穿板)","Plastic Color":"黑色","Board Space (Diameter φ/ Length x Width)":"3.2mm","Name":"={Manufacturer Part}","Description":"特性：彩色标记,便于观察和快速识别。是PC测试点终端的经济选择。卡扣式安装,为波峰焊提供可靠固定。线环设计,确保安全防滑测试。节省空间,有超薄和低轮廓设计。高轮廓设计,适用于难以触及的应用。适用于0.062(1.57)和0.093(2.36)PC板的高密度封装。可有效替代绕线柱和绕线架。能牢固夹住J型钩、EZ型钩、抓取器、鳄鱼夹、测试头或探针。高温尼龙底座,非常适合回流焊。非常适合可靠的生产测试和现场服务故障排除","SymbolName":"{\"name\":\"5011\",\"uuid\":\"fe009afe59d6e898\",\"source\":\"\"}","FootprintName":"{\"name\":\"TEST-TH_BD3.17-P1.87\",\"uuid\":\"3b5aaa45b8a2f4a5\",\"source\":\"\"}"}}|
